  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.7: Full frozen base-weight transpose-GEMM backpropagation across all 7 projections in CUDA VRAM (Q4_K, Q6_K, Q8_0, Q4_0, F32) and AVX-512/AVX2 SIMD; warp-aligned arbitrary-head_dim Causal GQA training attention; exact 64-bit tiled online Cross-Entropy backpropagation; ChatML assistant header masking; microbatch gradient averaging; TargetModules selection; Native AOT reflection-free serialization; hardened GgufMerger with F32 & PEFT layout support; 65 passing tests.",
